const bands=[['LOW','#ec9b1d','SHELF'],['LOW MID','#c5c831','BELL'],['MID','#d4b184','BELL'],['HIGH MID','#49bfd4','BELL'],['HIGH','#e34822','SHELF']];document.querySelector('#bands').innerHTML=bands.map(([n,c,t])=>`<article class="band" style="--accent:${c}"><h2>${n}</h2><button class="type active">◆</button><label>${t}</label><div class="knob control" data-name="${n} frequency"><span></span></div><label>Hz</label><h3>GAIN</h3><div class="knob gain control" data-name="${n} gain"><span></span></div><label>dB</label><h3>${n==='HIGH'?'SLOPE':'Q'}</h3><div class="knob small control" data-name="${n} Q"><span></span></div><div class="shape">⌒</div></article>`).join('');const toast=document.querySelector('#toast');let timer;function say(t){toast.textContent=t;toast.classList.add('show');clearTimeout(timer);timer=setTimeout(()=>toast.classList.remove('show'),1100)}document.querySelectorAll('button').forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('click',()=>{if(!b.closest('nav')&&b.textContent!=='‹'&&b.textContent!=='›')b.classList.toggle('active');say(b.getAttribute('aria-label')||b.textContent)}));document.querySelectorAll('.control').forEach(k=>{let down,y,v=0;const set=()=>k.style.setProperty('--turn',`${-130+(v+24)/48*260}deg`);set();k.addEventListener('pointerdown',e=>{down=true;y=e.clientY;k.setPointerCapture(e.pointerId)});k.addEventListener('pointermove',e=>{if(!down)return;v=Math.max(-24,Math.min(24,v+(y-e.clientY)/4));y=e.clientY;set();say(`${k.dataset.name}: ${Math.round(v)}`)});k.addEventListener('pointerup',()=>down=false)});document.querySelectorAll('[data-meter]').forEach(m=>{m.innerHTML=['L','R'].map(()=>`<div>${Array.from({length:12},(_,i)=>`<i data-i="${i}"></i>`).join('')}</div>`).join('');setInterval(()=>m.querySelectorAll('i').forEach((x,i)=>x.className=Math.random()>(i%12)/10?'on '+(i%12>8?'hot':''):''),180)});
